On AlphaNT Mail List, Jim Colwell[SMTP:colwell@drea.dnd.ca] wrote:
> Hi, does anyone know of an app to read VMS BACKUP and files11 tape formats
> from a winNT alpha ?  
> Jim Colwell, Ship Dynamics, DREA   ... AFC Rules (Pats in XXXIV)
> 

Not backup format, but this utility will do standard ANSI formatted 9 track and IBM 3480/3490/3490E tapes:

DIGITAL Tape Interchange System (TIS) V3.0 for Windows NT

 http://www.digital.com/info/CU7610/

You may also want to talk to the folks at Sector7 -- they are *very* knowledgable in VMS-to-NT data migration technologies.

 http://www.sector7.com/sector7_information/products.htm

Good luck,
